          IDENT  CARDS,100B
          PERIPH
          ORG    100B
*         PP PROGRAM: READS CARDS ON THE 405 CARD READER
*         (CHANNEL 12B) AND DISPLAYS THE FIRST 64 COLUMNS ON THE
*         CONSOLE.
*
*         EACH CARD GIVES 80 12-BIT WORDS: ONE COLUMN PER WORD,
*         ONE BIT PER PUNCH (BIT 11 = ROW 12, BIT 10 = ROW 11,
*         BIT 9 = ROW 0, BITS 8 TO 0 = ROWS 1 TO 9). THE PP
*         CONVERTS THE HOLLERITH CODE (029) TO DISPLAY CODE.
*         READING: FNC 702B, ACN, IAM OF 80 WORDS; THE CHANNEL
*         DISCONNECTS BY ITSELF AT THE END OF THE CARD. IF THE HOPPER
*         IS EMPTY, A REMAINS NONZERO.
*
*         BEFORE RUNNING: PERIPHERALS TAB > CARD READER, ENTER A
*         DECK, THEN LOAD IT INTO THE READER.
*
CH        EQU    12B         READER/PRINTER CHANNEL
FREAD     EQU    702B        READ ONE CARD
CHC       EQU    10B         CONSOLE CHANNEL
LSMALL    EQU    7000B       LEFT SCREEN, SMALL CHARACTERS
MAXC      EQU    24D         MAXIMUM NUMBER OF CARDS SHOWN
LLEN      EQU    34D         WORDS PER DISPLAYED LINE (2 + 32)
*
NC        EQU    20B         NUMBER OF CARDS READ
PL        EQU    21B         POINTER INTO THE DISPLAY AREA
PC        EQU    22B         POINTER INTO THE CARD
NW        EQU    23B         WORDS LEFT TO BUILD
V         EQU    24B         COLUMN TO CONVERT
D         EQU    25B         ROWS 1 TO 9 OF THE COLUMN
NR        EQU    26B         ROW NUMBER OF THE DIGIT
Z         EQU    27B         ZONE (0, 12, 11, 0)
EIGHT     EQU    30B         COMBINED 8 PUNCH
T1        EQU    31B
C1        EQU    32B         FIRST CHARACTER OF THE WORD
Y         EQU    33B         CURRENT Y COORDINATE
NT        EQU    34B         NUMBER OF WORDS TO DISPLAY
*
START     LDN    0
          STD    NC
          STD    NT
          LDC    AREA
          STD    PL
          LDC    7000B+700B
          STD    Y
*
*         READ ONE CARD
*
NEXTC     LDD    NC
          SBN    MAXC
          MJN    NEXTC1
          LJM    SHOW        DISPLAY AREA FULL
NEXTC1    FNC    FREAD,CH
          ACN    CH
          LDC    80D         80 COLUMNS
          IAM    CARD,CH
          ZJN    GOTC        CARD COMPLETE
          LJM    SHOW        HOPPER EMPTY: DISPLAY
GOTC      LDM    CARD        COLUMN 1
          SBN    17B         6/7/8/9 OR 7/8/9 CARD?
          ZJN    ENDC
          ADN    17B-7
          NJN    BUILD
ENDC      LJM    SHOW        END CARD: DISPLAY
*
*         BUILD A LINE: X, Y THEN 32 WORDS OF TWO CHARACTERS
*
BUILD     LDC    6000B       X = 0: 64 CHARACTERS PER LINE
          STI    PL          X COORDINATE
          AOD    PL
          LDD    Y
          STI    PL          Y COORDINATE
          AOD    PL
          LDD    Y
          SBN    14B         NEXT LINE BELOW
          STD    Y
          LDC    CARD
          STD    PC
          LDN    32D
          STD    NW
WORD      LDI    PC
          STD    V
          RJM    HOLL        FIRST CHARACTER
          SHN    6
          STD    C1
          AOD    PC
          LDI    PC
          STD    V
          RJM    HOLL        SECOND CHARACTER
          ADD    C1
          STI    PL
          AOD    PL
          AOD    PC
          SOD    NW
          NJN    WORD
          AOD    NC          ONE MORE CARD
          LDD    NT
          ADN    LLEN
          STD    NT
          LJM    NEXTC
*
*         CONSOLE REFRESH LOOP
*
SHOW      FNC    LSMALL,CHC
          ACN    CHC
          LDN    BANNERL
          OAM    BANNER,CHC
          LDD    NT
          OAM    AREA,CHC    CARD LINES
          DCN    CHC
          UJN    SHOW
*
*         HOLL: HOLLERITH COLUMN (V) -> A = DISPLAY CHARACTER
*
HOLLX     LJM    *
HOLL      EQU    *-1
          LDN    0
          STD    EIGHT
          STD    NR
          LDD    V
          LPC    777B        ROWS 1 TO 9
          STD    D
          ZJN    ZONES       NO DIGIT
          LMN    2
          ZJN    DIGIT       8 ALONE: ORDINARY DIGIT
          LDD    D
          LPN    2
          ZJN    DIGIT       NO 8 PUNCH
          AOD    EIGHT       COMBINED 8: SPECIAL CHARACTER
          LDD    D
          LMN    2           REMOVES THE 8 PUNCH
          STD    D
DIGIT     LDN    9D
          STD    NR
DIGIT1    LDD    D           LOOKS FOR THE ROW BIT
          LMN    1
          ZJN    ZONES
          LDD    D
          SHN    -1
          STD    D
          SOD    NR
          UJN    DIGIT1
ZONES     LDD    V
          SHN    -9D         ROWS 12, 11 AND 0
          STD    Z
          LDM    ZIDX,Z      ZONE NUMBER 0 TO 3
          STD    Z
          LDD    EIGHT
          NJN    SPEC
          LDD    Z           INDEX = 10*ZONE + DIGIT
          SHN    3
          ADD    Z
          ADD    Z
          ADD    NR
          STD    T1
          LDM    TAB,T1
          LJM    HOLLX
SPEC      LDD    Z           INDEX = 8*ZONE + DIGIT
          SHN    3
          ADD    NR
          STD    T1
          LDM    TAB8,T1
          LJM    HOLLX
*
*         CONVERSION TABLES (029 CODE)
*
ZIDX      CON    0,3,2,2,1,1,1,1 ROWS 12/11/0 -> ZONE
TAB       CON    55B,34B,35B,36B,37B,40B,41B,42B,43B,44B NO ZONE
          CON    67B,1B,2B,3B,4B,5B,6B,7B,10B,11B ZONE 12
          CON    46B,12B,13B,14B,15B,16B,17B,20B,21B,22B ZONE 11
          CON    33B,50B,23B,24B,25B,26B,27B,30B,31B,32B ZONE 0
TAB8      CON    43B,71B,0B,60B,74B,70B,54B,64B NO ZONE + 8
          CON    10B,71B,61B,57B,72B,51B,45B,66B ZONE 12 + 8
          CON    21B,71B,62B,53B,47B,52B,77B,76B ZONE 11 + 8
          CON    31B,71B,75B,56B,63B,65B,73B,71B ZONE 0 + 8
*
BANNER    CON    6000B+20B,7000B+740B
          DIS    21,405 CARD READER - DECK CONTENTS
BANNERL   EQU    *-BANNER
CARD      BSS    80D         CARD READ (80 COLUMNS)
AREA      BSS    MAXC*LLEN   LINES TO DISPLAY
          END
